# Code change response format

For every code modification in this project, structure the reply in this order:

1. File path or filename
2. Current code block
3. New code block

When creating an entirely new file, show the new file only.

Apply this to user-facing explanations of code changes. Do not skip the current code when a file already exists and is being edited.
